        "Rule 6(a) and the pinned text apply to this proceeding; applicability is an explicit supplied finding",
        "Period is stated in positive whole days, measured after an event; 1-366 days supported",
        "Calendar identifies the court and state and supplies consecutive days beginning at trigger plus period; at most 31 days",
        "Holiday findings include statutory observance days, presidential or congressional declarations, and applicable state declarations",
        "Clerk accessibility is a supplied finding appropriate to the filing method; court orders modifying its effect are excluded",
        "No additional service days, special counting method, extension, tolling, or other adjustment affects this calculation",
        "A date does not decide filing time, successful service, timeliness, jurisdiction, waiver, or remedies"
    ],
    review: ReviewStatus.Unreviewed
};
